@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber

participant "Client" as client
participant "Application" as app
participant "AWS S3" as s3

==upload==
activate client #FFBBBB
client -> app: 첨부 파일
activate app
app -> app: file binary를 disk에 저장 후 MultipartFile로 변환
app -> s3: file data
activate s3
note right: S3 object upload

s3 --> app: 저장 완료
deactivate s3

app --> client: 저장 완료
deactivate app
deactivate client


autonumber
==download==
client -> app: download key
activate client #FFAAFF
activate app

app -> s3: object key
activate s3
note right: S3 object download

s3 --> app: stream data를 file로 저장
app --> app: file -> Resource 변환
deactivate s3

app --> client: Resource
deactivate app
deactivate client

@enduml
